    "body": "I'm not sure if the navigation label really belongs on this PR since we're mostly impacting the behavior of srcdoc documents _once navigated to_. Separately, there may be other places in the spec where `about:srcdoc` being used raw should be replaced with `matches about:srcdoc` now, but I think I'd like to roll that evaluation into https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9488 and make that issue about evaluating the \"matches\" algorithms more completely.",
